Package: CellOnTools
Type: Package
Title: Toolkit for Cell Ontology Exploration and Application to Single-Cell Analysis
Version: 0.1.1
Date: 2026-07-14
Authors@R: person(given = "Di",
                  family = "Wang",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "wangdi0001@foxmail.com")
Description: Supports single-cell analysis workflows by standardising cell-type
    annotations against the Cell Ontology (CL). Converts free-text,
    cluster-derived, or manually reviewed cell-type labels to CL identifiers,
    attaches stable ontology terms to downstream metadata tables, explores
    ontology hierarchy and semantic similarity, rolls fine-grained annotations
    up to broader biological compartments, and evaluates cluster marker genes
    with over-representation analysis using bundled healthy human and mouse
    CellMarkerAccordion marker annotations from Busarello et al. (2025)
    <doi:10.1038/s41467-025-60900-4>.
